      69.84,
      506.16,
      310.09,
      564.23
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude which is required forthe public purpose mentioned below.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      79.92,
      580.56,
      237.76,
      590.63
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be Acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      608.88,
      310.18,
      645.11
    ],
    "text": "Following land depicted in Survey Plan No. P.P.MR 2791situated in the Village of Walliwala in Divisional Secretariat ofWeligama in Matara District.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      660.24,
      309.67,
      694.31
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01Name of land: Part of Assessment No. 118 alias Ekala SouthWestern allotment Kapparatota Road; Present use: Road;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
